  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "オカルトざっしの　きじに　あったマッドサイエンティストの　はつめいとちかい　とくちょうが　いくつかある。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "오컬트 잡지의 기사에 실렸던 매드 사이언티스트의 발명품과 비슷한 특징이 몇 가지 존재한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "有幾項特徵與超自然雜誌所報導的瘋狂科學家的發明很相似。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il ressemble un peu à l’invention d’un cerveau dément mentionnée dans une revue consacrée aux phénomènes paranormaux.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es weist einige Ähnlichkeiten mit der Erfindung eines verrückten Wissenschaftlers auf, die in einer esoterischen Zeitschrift erwähnt wurde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Comparte varios rasgos con el invento de un científico loco que apareció en un artículo de una revista esotérica.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Presenta caratteristiche simili a quelle di un’invenzione di uno scienziato pazzo descritta in una rivista di paranormale.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It has some similarities to a mad scientist’s invention covered in a paranormal magazine.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "オカルト雑誌の　記事に　あったマッドサイエンティストの　発明と近い　特徴が　いくつかある。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "它与超自然杂志所报道的疯狂科学家的发明有几项相近的特征。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Comparte varios rasgos con el invento de un científico loco que apareció en un artículo de una revista esotérica.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "とある　たんけんきのなかでテツノブジンという　なで　しるされたぶったいの　かのうせいが　ある。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "어느 탐험기에서 “무쇠무인”이라는 이름으로 기록된 물체일 가능성이 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "牠有可能就是在某本探險記裡，以鐵武者這個名字被記載下來的物體。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il pourrait s’agir de l’entité nommée « Garde-de-Fer », qui apparaît dans un certain récit d’exploration.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Möglicherweise handelt es sich hierbei um ein Objekt, das in einem gewissen Expeditionsbericht unter dem Namen Eisenkrieger erwähnt wurde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Podría tratarse del objeto que se menciona con el nombre de Ferropaladín en cierto diario.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È possibile che si tratti dell’oggetto denominato \"Eroeferreo\" in un certo diario di viaggio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It’s possible that this is the object listed as Iron Valiant in a certain expedition journal.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "とある　探検記の中でテツノブジンという　名で　記された物体の　可能性が　ある。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "它有可能就是某本探险记中记载的名为铁武者的物体。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
